# mingla-marketing Vercel project ignores. Read by Vercel when the project's
# Root Directory is set to `mingla-marketing`.
#
# Repo-root .vercelignore handles universal exclusions (other apps, supabase,
# scripts, etc.). This file handles ONLY project-internal cruft.
#
# Established by ORCH-0857 [Vercel .vercelignore project-aware split]
# 2026-05-17 after PR #122's cacheless build failure exposed that the prior
# repo-root .vercelignore listed `mingla-marketing/` itself — stripping the
# Next.js source from the marketing project's own deploy when cache was cold.
# Fix removed `mingla-marketing/` from the repo-root file; this per-project
# file handles internal exclusions. See
# docs/runbooks/VERCEL_VERCELIGNORE_ARCHITECTURE.md.

node_modules/
.env
.env.local
.next/
out/
